 desktop applications of its solutions on a platform, as well as the ability to develop custom applications. The company has a partnership with OpenAI to reimagine AI- and content-powered enterprise work that allows users to securely browse, access, and work with Box content directly in ChatGPT. The company was formerly known as Box.net, Inc. and changed its name to Box, Inc. in November 2011. Box, Inc. was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Redwood City, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Aaron  Levie | Co-Founder, CEO & Director | Age 40 | Compensation: $257,076 (FY2026)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 2K people. Revenue per employee of $404K ranks in the above the sector median among Technology peers, improving at 15%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $120K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $80K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (4/10).","financial_summary":["Box, Inc. is a mid-cap technology business with a $5.8B market cap on $1.2B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +6% over the past three years and +15% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size. Operating margins are expanding by +7.3pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at 115% against a 9% cost of capital \u2014 a 107-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat. Gross margins of 72% confirm genuine pricing power.","The business throws off $350M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 30 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 3.09\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","Accruals are elevated at -15.6% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, debt is moderate at 2.4\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, serviceable in normal conditions but worth watching through a downturn, and interest coverage runs at 7.8\u00d7.","Shareholder yield of 4.6% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and stock-based comp at 20% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 3.2% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.3\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 40% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 3 other valuation measures)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.3966270162082383},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (15.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $3.5M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 7% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (35% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Piotroski score 7/9 \u2014 financials improving across profitability, leverage and efficiency","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Technology peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Box (BOX) Is Getting Attention Again, What Is Behind The Focus?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/software/nyse-box/box/news/box-box-is-getting-attention-again-what-is-behind-the-focus","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793957838.414,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.888,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Box Unveils AI Agent Tools and NVIDIA Partnership at BoxWorks 2026","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/box-unveils-ai-agent-tools-001432521.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793924072.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.802,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"Box Partners With NVIDIA to Deliver the Trusted Content Layer for Enterprise AI","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/box-partners-nvidia-deliver-trusted-140000602.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793887200.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.872,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Box Unveils the Next Generation of Enterprise AI with New Agentic Workflow Automation and Advanced Threat Detection","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/box-unveils-next-generation-enterprise-140000354.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793887200.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.132,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"Box Unveils All-New Box for Industries to Securely Deliver Enterprise Context to AI and Transform Critical Workflows","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/techn